  "body": "<p>Each Strikingly template is beautifully designed with responsive layouts, so your site will look great on any device. Choose from hundreds of font styles and customize the colour, size, alignment, and spacing to fit your brand or personality. Add cool customizable effects like parallax scrolling and animation that work on desktop and mobile.</p><h2>Strikingly is a tool for building beautiful responsive sites in just minutes.</h2><p>Strikingly is a tool for building beautiful responsive sites in just minutes. The platform allows you to create your site without having any technical knowledge, and it has many great features that will help you make your site look amazing.</p><p>Strikingly’s drag-and-drop builder makes it easy to build a stunning website with the click of a mouse. You can choose from over 200 themes or start from scratch with an empty canvas, add custom images or videos, share anything on your page with Strikingly’s embeddable code generator, and much more!</p><h2>Strikingly’s site builder gives you the freedom and the power to design your website exactly how you want it.</h2><p>Strikingly’s site builder gives you the freedom and the power to design your website exactly how you want it.</p><p>The best part is that you can do this without web development experience. All it takes is a few clicks of your mouse or taps on your touchscreen (iPhone or iPad). The only limit is your imagination and creativity! You don’t need to be an expert graphic artist either – choose one of their pre-designed themes, customize the colours &amp; fonts, add some graphics or photos and start publishing!</p><h2>From minor tweaks to big ideas, Strikingly lets you make your site with ease.</h2><p>You can build your site at any time and on any device. You don’t have to be an expert—start with one of the pre-existing templates or customize one of them for your needs. You can make changes as you go, so if inspiration strikes halfway through the design process, don’t worry!</p><li>They have a lot of features that will help you get started in no time. Suppose you want to make changes to an existing template. In that case, their visual editor makes it easy for anyone who knows how to use a computer (or tablet) and even easier for those who don’t know anything about coding!</li><li>Whether you want an essential website or something more advanced like eCommerce capability or membership sites, they have the right tools at Strikingly.</li><h2>Each template is beautifully designed with responsive layouts, so your site will look great on any device.</h2><p>We’ve built their templates with responsive layouts so that your site looks great on any device. Responsive design is the best way to ensure your website is accessible on all devices, from phones and tablets to desktop computers.</p><p>You can choose from a wide range of beautiful responsive themes for Strikingly, making it easy to create an attractive and user-friendly website that works well across all screen sizes.</p><h2>Choose from hundreds of font styles and customize the colour, size, alignment, and spacing to fit your brand or personality.</h2><p>Strikingly also offers hundreds of font styles to choose from, with no restrictions on the number of fonts you can use. By default, all fonts are set as bold and italic however you can customize the colour, size, alignment, and spacing to fit your brand or personality.</p><h2>Add cool customizable effects like parallax scrolling and animation that work on desktop and mobile.</h2><p>The Strikingly editor lets you add parallax scrolling, animation, and other cool effects. Parallax scrolling is a technique that makes the background image move at a different speed than the foreground image, creating a 3D effect. You can use this effect to make it seem like the objects on your website are moving or changing over time. Animation is another option for making your website more visually engaging. The Strikingly editor has several pre-installed animations, such as fade in and fade out, zoom in/zoom out, pop from the center, and slide up/slide down (and sideways).</p><h2>These features help you produce a beautiful website for personal or business use.</h2><li>Free domain name: Strikingly offers you a free domain name for your website so you can get started immediately.</li><li>Beautiful templates: Strikingly has over 100+ templates to choose from that are fully customizable and easy to use. You can create a beautiful responsive website in just minutes by using one of these templates as a base or adding your design touches.</li><li>Fast loading time: Your website will load faster because Strikingly compresses all the images used on your site before it’s published online. This way, images take up less space on your site, and fewer requests are being made from their servers, which means faster loading times overall!</li><h2>Conclusion</h2><p>Strikingly is an excellent option for anyone who wants to create a fantastic website quickly without coding experience. It’s easy enough to use that you can get started right away but powerful enough to offer features like responsive layouts and parallax scrolling.</p>"
